ROSA is installed unmodified from PyPI (jpl-rosa). This project's own files
(config.py, robot_tools.py, rosa_agent.py) are Jamie Briggs's dissertation
work built on top of it.

The voice package (voice/) uses, unmodified, from PyPI:
  openWakeWord (Apache-2.0, David Scripka) for the wake word; models/truffles.onnx was
    trained with its tools for this project.
  Silero VAD v5 (MIT, Silero Team) through onnxruntime.
  sherpa-onnx (Apache-2.0, k2-fsa) running NVIDIA's Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 (CC-BY-4.0).
  Piper (GPL-3.0, OHF-Voice / Rhasspy) with the en_GB-alan-medium voice (MIT) for Rosa's voice.
